381295.description:
me crumpling a wrapper in front of a microphone. it makes a very satisfying sound! it also sounds like rain, or stones hitting the ground. i used a lot of sounds from free sound for a film i am making so i thought that i should help contribute to the community!

this is my first sound!

if using this for a school project or non-profit thing, don't worry about credit, but if you want to its fine. :)
if using this for commercial activities or for-profit things, please add something like: 
crumpling wrapper sfx - user "Dragon_of_AWESOMENESS" from free sound

i don't think its that good but perhaps someone can use it :)

